Z||000001||ferrari_momo||05-02-2001||11:43 PM||||yes, there will be one on may 18th or 19th.  it is on the saturday.  i might be there.  there will be fiero show and custom fiero stuff.  what king of fiero do u drive?  need some scoops, tail light kits, or any fiberglass fiero stuff?  email to: ferrari_momo@yahoo.com  or fieromoto@hotmail.com<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||stimpy||05-02-2001||11:55 PM||||BE THERE, BE THERE, BE THERE!!!! &lt;-very best Monster truck promo voice.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>The show registration begins at 10 am at Ferguson Pontiac in Norman. Take the Robinson exit off of I-35. Can't miss it on the east side of the interstate. Affordable lodging can be had at the Days Inn, and I'll be on hand there Friday night to meet and greet.<BR>After the show (around 3 ish) we'll be heading to a local park for a catered BBQ & awards "ceremony". Then there will be a cruise-in in OKC later that evening. Good times.<P>Cost for the whole she-bang is $25. A bargain. You'll have to forgive the antiquated website. I forgot we even had one. Let me know if you have any questions or if you'd like to pre-register.  <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
