Z||000005||Spektyr||05-03-2001||04:21 AM||||I'm definitely going, I got that night off work so I don't have to do the marathon 36 hours awake.  Looks like it might cost a small fortune to drive there, my gas mileage seems to be really bad for some reason.<P>4me, if you want to come but don't have the gas money, you can ride with me.  But then I'd figure you'd want to show off your new paint job...<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||1
Z||000006||sqoach||05-03-2001||01:13 PM||||I still hope I can make it. My car must not want to go, cuz she's not cooperating with me at all. I guess I don't need to take my car though. It's not like I'd register cuz my car is nothing close to being able to show.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">   <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||11
