Z||000008||stimpy||05-04-2001||09:29 AM||||That's the right attitude , 4me! My car has scuffed wheels, oxidized paint, and stanky sheepskin seatcovers from Target. Just run what ya brung! The main thing is getting together with other hardcore Fiero geeks, talk cars, eat some BBQ, and sip chilled malted adult beverages from discrete containers. I look forward to meetin y'all<P>Looks like Kansas is going to step up and represent.  What's up with Texas? Anyone from Arkansas or MO?<BR>||||reg||1
