Z||000010||Cheever2||05-05-2001||02:05 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Of course I have to work that Saturday.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Good news!  I traded weekends at work with another guy.  I work 2nd shift that Friday night, getting off at midnight, and it's a 10 hour drive, so I'd get there just in time, although I might be a little gamey by then  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> .  If my family goes, we'll get a room.  If not I'll be interested in sharing one Saturday night.<P>I'll have to talk to Cheeverette and the Little Cheevers, and will let you know.  <P>Is there a registration required (see website re: last year's show)?  Or can I just show up?<P>||||reg||1
